# 依赖与构建产物由容器内重新生成
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# 本地环境变量与机密不入镜像
**/.env*
!**/.env.example

# 无需进入镜像的本地/文档文件
.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store
docs
**/*.log

# 测试与 e2e 产物不进镜像
**/e2e
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
apps/web/playwright.config.ts
apps/web/scripts/e2e-with-db-guard.sh
